label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ghoulish Goods</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,040 Candy</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Decoration</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.40.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">October 7th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The Green Pumpkin is an item that can be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/Ghoulish_Goods\" title=\"Ghoulish Goods\">Ghoulish Goods</a> for 1,040 Candy in the Halloween 2023 update.\n</p><p>In the Halloween 2024 event, Green Pumpkins can spawn in patches that spawn on <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a>, though at a lower rate than the normal <a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a>.  These pumpkins can vary in size, with bigger pumpkins being rarer than their smaller variants.\n</p><p>Depending on their size, green pumpkins can sell for <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">candy</a>, increasing as they get bigger. This is also the case with <a href=\"/wiki/Composter\" title=\"Composter\">Composters</a>, as larger pumpkins can fill them quicker than their smaller variants.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163305\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 63/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 67/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019479/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.528      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   38.528      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2155-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163305 and revision id 14936. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Event_Items","Items","Decorative_Item"],"links":[{"title":"Candy","exists":true},{"title":"Composter","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true},{"title":"Ghoulish Goods","exists":true},{"title":"Pumpkin","exists":true}],"images":["GreenPumpkinOutline.png"]}
